   "detail": "Closed or local traffic only from 6 pm: Marcy (Hancock to State, and under the bridge to Daniel), Daniel (Bow to Market Square), Bow (Daniel to Market), Market (Hanover to Market Square), Fleet (Hanover to State), Congress (Market to Maplewood), Pleasant (Court to Market Square), State (Fleet to Marcy), Porter (Fleet to Pleasant). No parking on the route 5 to 10 pm; cars still there at 5 pm are towed at the owner's expense. Garages: Hanover, Foundry Place, Worth Lot, Bridge Street Lot at normal rates. It is the 31st independently organized parade.",
